  "description": "Populate each next pointer to point to its next right node in a binary tree.",
  "pseudocode": "let head = root;\nwhile (head) {\n  let dummy = {next: null}, tail = dummy;\n  for (let curr = head; curr; curr = curr.next) {\n    if (curr.left) { tail.next = curr.left; tail = tail.next; }\n    if (curr.right) { tail.next = curr.right; tail = tail.next; }\n  }\n  head = dummy.next;\n}",
